  "sourceTitle": "Caramel Pecan Banana Sundae",
  "sourceText": "Caramel Pecan Banana Sundae\nBy: BETH ROAN\nPublished: Tuesday, May 15, 2012 - 7:29am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 Medium Bananas, sliced\n2 Tablespoons Sugar-Free Caramel Sauce\n2 Tablespoons Chopped Pecans\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Warm caramel sauce in the microwave for 15 seconds (30 if it has been refrigerated). Pour sauce over bananas and top with pecans.\n\nAbout\n\nQuick, healthy and extremely easy dessert for when a sweet tooth hits.",
